# 1. Purpose

The purpose of this Project Charter is to formally establish and authorize the Adaptive Vehicle Intelligence Architecture (AVIA) project as a structured systems engineering initiative.

This document defines the project's purpose, vision, mission, objectives, scope, governance, and guiding engineering philosophy. It provides the strategic foundation from which all subsequent engineering activities, specifications, architectures, analyses, and validation efforts are derived.

The Project Charter serves as the highest-level engineering document within the AVIA project, providing direction and alignment for all engineering work while ensuring that project development remains disciplined, traceable, objective-driven, and consistent with established systems engineering practices.
